<p>qasim jo ham shabi-e janaab-e ameer tha<br />
is wajha se wo gheerat-e mehre muneer tha<br />
aur aashiq-e- jamaal-e- shah-e benazeer tha<br />
parwana-e- charagh-e- rasool-e- qadeer tha</p>

<p>akbar se kehta tha ke chacha to imaam hai<br />
aye bhai jaan ham to tumhaare ghulaam hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte the ke tum mere dada ki shaan ho<br />
dil ho jigar ho aankh ho bhaai ki jaan ho<br />
aye bhaai jaan kya teri khoobi bayaan ho<br />
hazrat hassan ki tarha se shiree'n zabaan ho</p>

<p>phir pyar se wo haatho'n ko gardan me daalke<br />
kehte the qatl honge ham atthara saal ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>itne me fouj-e- zulm se teer-e- jafaa chale<br />
aur yaa'n se peshwaayi ko ahl-e wafaa chale<br />
aaye khuda ki simt se soo-e- khuda chale<br />
kehte the shaah zor-e- muqaddar se kya chale</p>

<p>qaasim rahe aur akbar-o- abbas rehgaye<br />
sattar do tan me teen jawaa'n paas rehgaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>is gham se jo hussain ki haalat huwi tabaah<br />
tab haath pakde qaime me qaasim ko laaye shaah<br />
zainab se phir ye bole imaam-e- falak panaah<br />
darpesh ham ko aaj hai do bekaso'n ka byaah</p>

<p>taqreeb soghwaaro me dulha dulhan ki hai<br />
zainab utho utho yeh wasiyaat hassan ki hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ibne hassan ko laake libaas-e hassan pinhaao<br />
qaasim ki maa ko maadar-e- kubra ko jald laao<br />
wo boli jaan bhujh-ke bhaiyya na ye sunaao<br />
is kaam ke liye to kisi aur ko bulaao</p>

<p>maatam ke ghar se koi bhi jaata hai byaah me<br />
beto'n mo-i ko koi bulata hai byaah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jin hatho'n se ke beto'n ki lashe uthaau'n mai<br />
un haatho'n se bhatije ko dulha banaau'n mai<br />
farsh-e- aza jo yaa'n paye maatam bichaau'n mai<br />
kubra ko waa'n libaas-e- uroosi pinhaau'n mai</p>

<p>kyu'n kar bhala ye usse ho jo qair qaah ho<br />
meri to ye duaa hai mubarak ye biyaah ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yaadash baqair fatema sughra nahi yahaa'n<br />
ruqsat ke waqt kehti thi mujh se wo naatawaa'n<br />
qaasim ka byaah howe safar me jo naagahaa'n<br />
tum mujhko yaad karke bula lijiyo wahaa'n</p>

<p>afsos ki jagah hai koi naamabar nahi<br />
qaasim ka byaah hota hai usko qabar nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sheh ne kaha bahan na taraddud karo zara<br />
maatam ka apne beto'n ke haan uzr hai baja<br />
ye aqd bhi hai fidya-e- sibt-e- rasool ka<br />
shaadi kujaa aur aal-e- rasoole- quda kujaa</p>

<p>jaayega namuraad ye dulha jahaa'n se<br />
taa hashr shaadi uth gayi is khaandaa'n se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehti thi yu'n phupi se sakina ke kya hai gham<br />
lo bhaai dulha bante hai ab nek lenge hum<br />
saamaan-e- aqd jama parishaan magar haram<br />
qaasim ki maa pukaari fida aye shah-e- umam</p>

<p>loundi hoon aaj se mai shah-e- qushqisaal ki<br />
shaadi hussain karte hai beva ke laal ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>is ghar me ab na hoyega aisa bhi koi byaah<br />
ab tum ho qald khaana hai aur zulm ki sipaah<br />
zainab pukaari qair jo farmaaye mujh ko shaah<br />
shaahana pairahan bhi to ghar me nahi hai aah</p>

<p>shah roke bole aap to ahle shaoor ho<br />
qillat agar na ho agar pa kafan ek zaroor ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bin maa ki beti kaa bhi koi yu kare na byaah<br />
ye koun din hai byaah ka samjho to dil me aah<br />
paani ka qahat khaane ka dukh nargha-e- sipaah<br />
mehmaan judaa azizou ke marne se hai tabaah</p>

<p>faryaad ek taraf hai kahi'n shor-o- aah hai<br />
qudrat quda ki ye meri beti ka byaah hai<br />
____________________________</p>